title: Trades - Vintage Story Wiki
description: What wandering traders buy and sell, per specialization.
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: "{{ lang }}/trades/index.html"
---
{% import "macros/datatable.njk" as dt %}
<h1>Trades</h1>
<p class="muted">
  Wandering traders each specialize in one category and buy/sell a fixed list of items at a
  price/stock range (shown as average &plusmn; variance below). Which specialization a given
  trader entity uses, and their dialogue, aren't covered here -- trader personality assignment is
  a variant-driven mechanic on the trader entity itself, and the dialogue is a genuine branching
  conversation tree, not flat flavor text worth extracting.
</p>
<p class="muted">Source: <code>config/tradelists/trader-&lt;specialization&gt;.json</code>.</p>

{% call dt.datatable(40, "Search trade specializations...", ["Specialization", "Selling", "Buying", "Mod"]) %}
{% for trade in generated.trades | sort(false, false, "id") %}
  <tr data-search="{{ trade.id }}" data-mod="{{ trade.sourceMod }}">
    <td><a href="{{ ('/' ~ lang ~ '/') | url }}trades/{{ trade.id | slugify }}/">{{ trade.id.split(':')[1] }}</a></td>
    <td>{{ trade.selling.length }} items</td>
    <td>{{ trade.buying.length }} items</td>
    <td><span class="tag">{{ trade.sourceMod }}</span></td>
  </tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endcall %}
